      "content": "it's more than just feeling undervalued. it's like the loop is so perfect that it's actually impossible to break. no matter what i do, the machine just keeps spinning. i try to think about a future or something, but i can't even see past the next shift. how am i supposed to find \"value\" when the whole structure of my life is designed to just use me up and move on?",
